"DESIGN CORRECTION from user (supersedes the surface-flag approach, which must be REMOVED): no new component. LocationComponent itself becomes a STRUCT { location_entity_id, kind } with enum LocationKind { Exterior, Interior } (exterior renames surface). Location COMPARISONS treat (id, Exterior) and (id, Interior) as two different locations; INVENTORY checks (carried) match on id alone, either kind. Behavior derives from location VALUES: an outdoor room's own edge is (world_surface, Exterior); occupants arriving in a room take the room's own edge kind (else Interior); visibility recursion follows Exterior edges upward. Implementation: kind field on component + blob (authored kind on outdoorRoom/sky), compiler-driven sweep of every constructor site, comparison helper for co-location (id+kind) vs carried (id)."